	(text "TODO: LEDs suck a lot of power.\nIt might be good to keep them for test\nunits and DNP them for production.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.95 -26.162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2431a6d9-01ca-49a3-b982-47aaec783f2c")
	)
	(text "AP62300: Vout => R1 = R2 * (Vout/Vfb - 1)\nR1 = R15; R2 = R16; Vfb = 0.8\nFor our purposes we want something like 5.5-5.7V out. \nSet R16 to 10k so R5 ~ 10k*(5.6 / 0.8 - 1) = 60k\nUsing 62k E12 gives 5.76V out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.548 56.896 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2b547596-a3f2-4efc-a71c-919f41bf491e")
	)
	(text "12V-18V in"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.082 37.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "450f4f98-c2dc-4205-8443-4adda04008f1")
	)
	(text "Max current is 1A. Rsense = 0.1\nso max power dissipation is 100mW\nthrough Rsense.\n@20mA Vdrop,Rsense = 2mV\n@1A   Vdrop,Rsense = 100mV\n\nGain = 10 for [20mV, 1V] output\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.928 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "552c60f5-94b5-4e1d-915b-3a67f20cccb9")
	)
	(text "Current Sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.994 57.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8f2cdbc8-d6e2-46af-9e75-d7e6fe32d179")
	)
	(text "AGND and DGND are tied together \ninternally to the MCP320X. This \nconnection should be as close to \nthay chip as possible."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.698 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "90f1cc3b-5c42-4dfe-a76a-97f7a43f10cf")
	)
	(text "Reference Decoupling\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.002 155.194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9d8298cf-5b0c-4900-b73e-c61f70a04696")
	)
	(text "TODO: U11 is referenced to \nDIG_PRE_GND so its output will \nbe offset by the drop across \nR28 (Rsense). For example at\nI=20mA Rsense will have a drop of 2mV\nand U11 will output 20mV; however, \nthis is referenced to DIG_PRE_GND which is\n2mV lower than DIGITAL_GND and so will\nbe read as 18mV.\nLikewise with 1Amp, Rsense will drop 100mV,\nU11 will output 1V but referenced to \nDIG_PRE_GND which will be 100mV lower than \nDIGITAL_GND and so will be read as 900mV."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225.806 116.078 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a9719d5f-e4af-4224-9b79-b1363f657114")
	)
	(text "Need a 3.7V to 5V boost converter for battery\npower, and a 3.7V Li Ion battery charger. \nStill not sure on how much power we need for\ncloudy day and overnight operation but we can \nprobably size the battery later. \nActually, I think we'll add a separate battery\ncircuit as its own thing. It will be self-contained\nand all we need here are a couple of lines to \nprovide battery power and return and a current shunt\nfor battery monitoring. I think maybe I'll also include \nthe battery shunt and amplifier in the battery module. \nThis just means we need a +/- and sense pin for the battery\nmodule.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.608 -14.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c617f0a3-6728-4868-a272-165699edb34b")
	)
	(text "Switched 5.0V and 4.096V, 2.5V references"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.256 79.248 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ec929f41-ee6e-42ba-846b-e5e0601096f7")
	)
	(text "TODO: Add a MOV "
