			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f000fcc7-1f2f-47c3-8266-4f1cef448a6d")
	)
	(text "NOTE: If we plug in the USB on the ESP module\nwhat happens? There will be +5V on the +5V_IN\n-- will that backfeed and blow up the MCP1727\n(potentially YES)?\nDo we want to put a Shottky diode or p-fet on the\noutput?\nWe also need to have a way to charge an internal \nbattery when power is connected and supply power\nfrom the battery when power is removed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 235.204 -10.668 0)
		(effects
